# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ALLOW-LIST: this public repo publishes the website only.
# Everything is ignored by default; only the files below are
# allowed. To publish a new site file, add a "!" line for it.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# 1. Ignore everything in the project folder…
/*

# 2. …except the website files
!/.gitignore
!/index.html
!/privacy.html
!/poster.jpg
!/bitaxiss-ad2-16x9.mp4

# 3. Images used in automated emails (served from www.bitaxis.in/email/)
!/email/
/email/*
!/email/*.jpg
!/email/*.png

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Safety net: never commit these, even if allowed above
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.pdf
*recovery*
*.json
*.gs
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.log
